msgid ""
"The JST-GH-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 9v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral "
"requiring 5v. The 9v supply is controlled by either (depending on board "
"version) RELAY 2 set to GPIO 81 or RELAY 3 set to GPIO 82, and they are on "
"by default. These can be configured to be operated by an RC switch or via "
"GCS command (Mission Planner AUX tab)"
msgstr ""
"JST-GH-6P连接器支持标准DJI HD图传连接。连接器第1针为9V，请注意不要将其连接到需要5V的外设。9V供电由RELAY 2（设置为GPIO "
"81）或RELAY 3（设置为GPIO 82，具体取决于板子版本）控制，默认开启。可配置为通过遥控开关或地面站命令（Mission Planner "
"AUX选项卡）进行操作"

